IO-23: report a unit hydrograph group that has no rain gage

A [HYDROGRAPHS] group without a "Name Gage" line ran with no rainfall and
so produced no RDII, without a message. The [HYDROGRAPHS] validation now
reports the new ERROR 152 (as in the 5.3.0 patch) for a group that has no
gage line naming an existing gage, when the model has [RDII] inflows (legacy
validates unit hydrographs only then).

Apply from the root of a Stormwater-Management-Model checkout at cb3e192b:
    git apply IO-23_swmm600.patch

